{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"量子几何Langlands纲领"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"量子几何 Langlands 纲领"},2]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>量子几何 Langlands 纲领认为复曲线上 $G$-丛模空间上的扭曲 D-模的导出范畴和和 $G^L$-丛模空间的相应范畴之间存在一个等价.</p>\n"}}